    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "03. Moving",
    "ruleNumber": "03.02",
    "summary": "Units are placed on the battlefield before they can move or attack, most often at deployment but sometimes for other reasons. When a rule calls for setting up a unit, its models must be placed with:\n\n- the unit in **coherency** (03.03)\n- the unit **unengaged** (03.04)\n- every other requirement and restriction met\n\nIf any model cannot be placed, remove the unit and return it to where it came from, such as **strategic reserves** or inside a **TRANSPORT**.",
